<title>THAILAND: Charoen Pokphand '96 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Charoen Pokphand '96 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for</p>
<p>1996 ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>			     Twelve months</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		11.93	vs	   11.72</p>
